<title>HONG KONG: Matrix half-year profit HK$4.11 mln.</title>
<headline>Matrix half-year profit HK$4.11 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.92   vs 0.23</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil    vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    4.11   vs 1.04</p>
<p>    Turnover		     253.64 vs 129.43</p>
<p>    Company name		 Matrix Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Matrix Holdings is a music box manufacturer.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year end to December 31 from August 31. Comparative figures are for six months ended February 28, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
